        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    }
  ],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "Porte un coup dévastateur à l’ennemi.\nPeut briser des rochers fissurés.\nPeut baisser la Défense.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "black-white",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/11/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The user attacks with a punch that can\nshatter a rock. It may also lower the\ntarget’s Defense stat.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "black-white",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/11/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The user attacks with a punch that can\nshatter a rock. It may also lower the\ntarget’s Defense stat.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "black-2-white-2",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/14/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "パンチで　こうげき。　あいての\nぼうぎょを　さげる　ことが　ある。\nいわを　くだくことも　できる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "펀치로 공격한다.\n상대의 방어를 떨어뜨릴 때가 있으며\n바위를 깰 수도 있다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Porte un coup de poing à l’ennemi qui peut\nbaisser sa Défense. Peut aussi briser des rochers\nfissurés.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Der Anwender greift mit einem Hieb an, der den\nVerteidigungs-Wert des Zieles senken kann.\nDamit können auch Steine zerschlagen werden.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Espejo misterioso que refleja la verdad y\ndevuelve los Pokémon a su forma original.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Chi la usa colpisce il nemico con un pugno\nin grado di frantumare anche la roccia.\nPuò anche ridurne la Difesa.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The user attacks with a punch. This may\nalso lower the target’s Defense stat. This\nmove can also shatter rocks in the field.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "パンチで　攻撃する。相手の\n防御を　さげる　ことが　ある。\n岩を　砕くことも　ある。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Espejo misterioso que refleja la verdad y\ndevuelve los Pokémon a su forma original.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "おおきな　なみで　じぶんの\nまわりに　いるものを　こうげきする。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "큰 파도로 자신의\n주위에 있는 포켓몬을 공격한다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "使用大浪\n攻擊自己周圍所有的寶可夢。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Une énorme vague s’abat sur le champ de bataille\net inflige des dégâts à tous les Pokémon autour\ndu lanceur.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Anwender greift mit einer gewaltigen Welle\nalle Pokémon in seiner Umgebung an.",
